"@%SystemRoot%\\system32\\APHostRes.dll,-10001"="This service synchronizes mail, contacts, calendar and various other user data. Mail and other applications dependent on this functionality will not work properly when this service is not running."
"@%systemroot%\\system32\\p9rdrservice.dll,-101"="Enables trigger-starting plan9 file servers."
